      "archive_timestamp": "20250612025124",
      "article_id": "article_6bb708cbf0fe8c65",
      "body_recovery_method": "wayback",
      "context_excerpt": "France-based OpenAirInterface (OAI) and NVIDIA are collaborating to advance AI-native wireless networks by integrating OAI’s open-source virtualized and open RAN stack with the GPU-accelerated NVIDIA AI Aerial – and NVIDIA Sionna -based systems. OAI provides the layer 2+ software for Aerial Commercial Testbed and full-stack O-RAN software for Sionna Research Kit, enabling researchers to innovate in 5G and 6G radio access networks using AI and machine learning at every layer.",
