      "body_recovery_method": "wayback",
      "context_excerpt": "ETH Zurich and NVIDIA are working on 6G projects related to the performance of AI-native 6G networks. This includes a new machine learning-based architecture, called DUIDD (Deep Unfolded Iterative Detector Decoder), which was developed using NVIDIA Sionna to improve the amount of data a base station can transmit or receive using information learned from its local environment. DUIDD is expected to be implemented on the real-time, over-the-air NVIDIA AI Aerial commercial testbed, dubbed ARC-OTA.",
